  "prefLabel": "En 2102.07 Distribution system information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 2102.07 “Distribution system information” means information concerning the specific location or characteristics of part or all of the utility’s distribution system or other non-customer-specific, non-public information that is not available on an equivalent basis to non-affiliated competitors.\n\nSource. #14519, eff 2-26-26, EXPIRES: 2-26-36",
